5	// `<pack>/skills/<skill>/checks.mjs` beside it — before activation is consulted,
6	// so a repo that declares none of them still loads all of them. Any module in
7	// that import graph is therefore re-entered while it is still evaluating, if it
8	// is also the process entry point. A `await` at the entry block's own statement
9	// level holds that evaluation open forever: the re-import can never resolve, the
10	// await never settles, and Node exits 13 ("unsettled top-level await") having run
11	// nothing. #581 shipped exactly that — `interview.mjs check` deadlocked in every
12	// repo, in every declaration, and the SessionStart orchestrator's fail-soft
13	// swallowed it as a merely-absent note.
