3	// Generic scanning helpers for checks. The caller owns which files matter and
4	// which tokens are forbidden or required — these helpers only do the walking,
5	// so a check that must assert a word's presence or absence over a file set
6	// stays a few lines long. Nothing here carries content knowledge of its own.
