123	  }
124	
125	  // Tracked lines still naming a path this change deletes: [{ file, line, text, gone }].
126	  // A hit whose every occurrence widens to a path token that still resolves is a
127	  // rename that kept the basename, not a dangling reference — dropped. `tolerated(gone)`
